{
  "job": "upscale",
  "want": "character",
  "rank": 5,
  "short": "blurred background: only the character redrawn",
  "title": {
    "zh": "放大·只重画人物",
    "en": "Upscale, only the character redrawn"
  },
  "about": {
    "zh": "背景本来就虚化的图用：整张用放大模型拉大，背景不再动；自动抠出人物，只裁出那一块重画再缝回去。虚化原样保住，人物变清楚；Anima 上有 Tile 时照着原图的线条画。背景清楚的图请用「Tile 锁图放大」。",
    "en": "For a picture whose background is blurred on purpose: an upscale model enlarges it all and the background stays as it is; the character is cut out and only its crop is redrawn and stitched back. The blur is kept, the character gets sharper; on Anima with the Tile it follows the picture's lines. A sharp background: Upscale held by Tile."
  },
  "source": {
    "zh": "2026-11-10 的虚化背景放大对照：整张重画把远处的铁轨和树画清楚了，景深没了；整张拉大、只重画人物保住了虚化，只裁人物来重画最快",
    "en": "A blurred-background upscale comparison of 2026-11-10: a whole redraw drew the far tracks and trees sharp and the depth was lost; enlarging it all and redrawing only the character kept the blur, a crop of the character the fastest"
  },
  "packs": {
    "InspyrenetRembg": "comfyui-inspyrenet-rembg",
    "InpaintCropImproved": "ComfyUI-Inpaint-CropAndStitch",
    "InpaintStitchImproved": "ComfyUI-Inpaint-CropAndStitch"
  },
  "extras": {
    "AnimaLLLiteApply_sdscripts": "ComfyUI-Anima-LLLite"
  },
  "upscaler": true,
  "upscale_by": 1.5,
  "nodes": {
    "own": {
      "class_type": "CheckpointLoaderSimple",
      "copy_of": "$sampler.model",
      "_meta": {"title": "Upscale model"},
      "inputs": {}
    },
    "upscaler": {
      "class_type": "UpscaleModelLoader",
      "inputs": {"model_name": "$upscaler"}
    },
    "enlarge": {
      "class_type": "ImageUpscaleWithModel",
      "inputs": {"upscale_model": ["upscaler", 0], "image": ["$save.images", "*"]}
    },
    "fit": {
      "class_type": "ImageScaleBy",
      "inputs": {"image": ["enlarge", 0], "upscale_method": "lanczos", "scale_by": "$fit"}
    },
    "cut": {
      "class_type": "InspyrenetRembg",
      "inputs": {"image": ["fit", 0], "torchscript_jit": "default"}
    },
    "solid": {
      "class_type": "ThresholdMask",
      "inputs": {"mask": ["cut", 1], "value": 0.5}
    },
    "edge": {
      "class_type": "GrowMask",
      "inputs": {"mask": ["solid", 0], "expand": 12, "tapered_corners": true}
    },
    "as_picture": {
      "class_type": "MaskToImage",
      "inputs": {"mask": ["edge", 0]}
    },
    "fade": {
      "class_type": "ImageBlur",
      "inputs": {"image": ["as_picture", 0], "blur_radius": 31, "sigma": 0.5}
    },
    "area_mask": {
      "class_type": "ImageToMask",
      "inputs": {"image": ["fade", 0], "channel": "red"}
    },
    "crop": {
      "class_type": "InpaintCropImproved",
      "inputs": {
        "image": ["fit", 0],
        "mask": ["area_mask", 0],
        "downscale_algorithm": "lanczos",
        "upscale_algorithm": "lanczos",
        "preresize": false,
        "preresize_mode": "ensure minimum resolution",
        "preresize_min_width": 1024,
        "preresize_min_height": 1024,
        "preresize_max_width": 16384,
        "preresize_max_height": 16384,
        "mask_fill_holes": false,
        "mask_expand_pixels": 0,
        "mask_invert": false,
        "mask_blend_pixels": 0,
        "mask_hipass_filter": 0.0,
        "extend_for_outpainting": false,
        "extend_up_factor": 1.0,
        "extend_down_factor": 1.0,
        "extend_left_factor": 1.0,
        "extend_right_factor": 1.0,
        "context_from_mask_extend_factor": 1.2,
        "output_resize_to_target_size": false,
        "output_target_width": 1024,
        "output_target_height": 1024,
        "output_padding": "32",
        "device_mode": "cpu (compatible)"
      }
    },
    "soft": {
      "class_type": "DifferentialDiffusion",
      "inputs": {"model": ["own", 0]}
    },
    "encode": {
      "class_type": "VAEEncode",
      "inputs": {"pixels": ["crop", "cropped_image"], "vae": ["$decode.vae", "*"]}
    },
    "area": {
      "class_type": "SetLatentNoiseMask",
      "inputs": {"samples": ["encode", 0], "mask": ["crop", "cropped_mask"]}
    },
    "redraw": {
      "class_type": "KSampler",
      "like": "$sampler",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["soft", 0],
        "positive": ["$sampler.positive", "*"],
        "negative": ["$sampler.negative", "*"],
        "latent_image": ["area", 0],
        "denoise": 0.45
      }
    },
    "decode": {
      "class_type": "VAEDecode",
      "inputs": {"samples": ["redraw", 0], "vae": ["$decode.vae", "*"]}
    },
    "stitch": {
      "class_type": "InpaintStitchImproved",
      "inputs": {"stitcher": ["crop", "stitcher"], "inpainted_image": ["decode", 0]}
    },
    "save": {
      "class_type": "SaveImage",
      "inputs": {"images": ["stitch", 0], "filename_prefix": "upscaled_character"}
    },
    "look": {
      "class_type": "PreviewImage",
      "inputs": {"images": ["fade", 0]}
    }
  },
  "after": "run_workflow saves the picture as before and the 1.5x one beside it (prefix upscaled_character): the whole picture enlarged by an upscale model, the background left as it is, only the character (cut out, cropped with a margin) redrawn at denoise 0.45 with its own copy of the canvas's model and LoRAs (the loader titled Upscale model) and stitched back. Only for a background blurred on purpose: on a sharp one the character comes out sharper than the enlarged background; there use want=\"detail\". A second model for the character: set_model that loader to one of the same family. The preview shows what is redrawn (white): part of the character missing, or the background in it, say so.",
  "gives": {
    "sampler": "redraw",
    "save": "save"
  },
  "own_model": {
    "nodes": ["own_1", "own"],
    "copies_loras": true
  },
  "notes": "In the 2026-11-10 comparison (an Anima picture with a blurred background, 1440x1024 to 2160x1536, RealSkin) a whole Tile redraw at 0.85 drew the far tracks and trees sharp, hazed the picture and lost the depth; enlarging it all and redrawing only the character kept the background to the pixel and sharpened the face. The crop (the character's mask, 20% more around it, not resized) took 153 s where redrawing over the whole enlarged picture took 270 s. The mask is the refine_character way's: cut out, made solid, grown 12 px, blurred about 15 px for a fading edge with Differential Diffusion. On Anima an optional animaTileRepair LLLite holds the lines at denoise 0.7; without the Tile file the node goes and 0.45 is the strength.",
  "models": ["2x_animesharp_v4", "4x_ultrasharp", "anima_tile_repair"],
  "tested": {
    "gpu": "RTX 4050 Laptop",
    "vram_gb": 6,
    "date": "2026-11-10",
    "runs": [
      {
        "model": "Anima (Harem 1.5, its own copy redrawing the character, the Tile, denoise 0.7, 2x-AnimeSharpV4)",
        "size": "832×1216 → 1.5×",
        "seconds": 223
      }
    ]
  },
  "variants": {
    "anima": {
      "optional_lllite": {
        "tile": "tile"
      },
      "nodes": {
        "own": {
          "class_type": "UNETLoader",
          "copy_of": "$sampler.model",
          "_meta": {"title": "Upscale model"},
          "inputs": {}
        },
        "upscaler": {
          "class_type": "UpscaleModelLoader",
          "inputs": {"model_name": "$upscaler"}
        },
        "enlarge": {
          "class_type": "ImageUpscaleWithModel",
          "inputs": {"upscale_model": ["upscaler", 0], "image": ["$save.images", "*"]}
        },
        "fit": {
          "class_type": "ImageScaleBy",
          "inputs": {"image": ["enlarge", 0], "upscale_method": "lanczos", "scale_by": "$fit"}
        },
        "cut": {
          "class_type": "InspyrenetRembg",
          "inputs": {"image": ["fit", 0], "torchscript_jit": "default"}
        },
        "solid": {
          "class_type": "ThresholdMask",
          "inputs": {"mask": ["cut", 1], "value": 0.5}
        },
        "edge": {
          "class_type": "GrowMask",
          "inputs": {"mask": ["solid", 0], "expand": 12, "tapered_corners": true}
        },
        "as_picture": {
          "class_type": "MaskToImage",
          "inputs": {"mask": ["edge", 0]}
        },
        "fade": {
          "class_type": "ImageBlur",
          "inputs": {"image": ["as_picture", 0], "blur_radius": 31, "sigma": 0.5}
        },
        "area_mask": {
          "class_type": "ImageToMask",
          "inputs": {"image": ["fade", 0], "channel": "red"}
        },
        "crop": {
          "class_type": "InpaintCropImproved",
          "inputs": {
            "image": ["fit", 0],
            "mask": ["area_mask", 0],
            "downscale_algorithm": "lanczos",
            "upscale_algorithm": "lanczos",
            "preresize": false,
            "preresize_mode": "ensure minimum resolution",
            "preresize_min_width": 1024,
            "preresize_min_height": 1024,
            "preresize_max_width": 16384,
            "preresize_max_height": 16384,
            "mask_fill_holes": false,
            "mask_expand_pixels": 0,
            "mask_invert": false,
            "mask_blend_pixels": 0,
            "mask_hipass_filter": 0.0,
            "extend_for_outpainting": false,
            "extend_up_factor": 1.0,
            "extend_down_factor": 1.0,
            "extend_left_factor": 1.0,
            "extend_right_factor": 1.0,
            "context_from_mask_extend_factor": 1.2,
            "output_resize_to_target_size": false,
            "output_target_width": 1024,
